.SH "Nano ID"
.PP

.PP
\fBEnglish\fP | \fBРусский\fP | \fB简体中文\fP | \fBBahasa Indonesia\fP

.PP
A tiny, secure, URL-friendly, unique string ID generator for JavaScript\&.

.PP
.RS 4
“An amazing level of senseless perfectionism, which is simply impossible not to respect\&.” 
.RE
.PP

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBSmall\&.\fP 130 bytes (minified and gzipped)\&. No dependencies\&. \fRSize Limit\fP controls the size\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBFast\&.\fP It is 2 times faster than UUID\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBSafe\&.\fP It uses hardware random generator\&. Can be used in clusters\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBShort IDs\&.\fP It uses a larger alphabet than UUID (\fRA-Za-z0-9_-\fP)\&. So ID size was reduced from 36 to 21 symbols\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBPortable\&.\fP Nano ID was ported to \fB20 programming languages\fP\&.
.PP

.PP
.PP
.nf
import { nanoid } from 'nanoid'
model\&.id = nanoid() //=> "V1StGXR8_Z5jdHi6B\-myT"
.fi
.PP

.PP
Supports modern browsers, IE \fRwith Babel\fP, Node\&.js and React Native\&.

.PP
